WEBVTT

00:06:26.215 --> 00:06:30.344
that the coming years are going to be
interesting, to say the least.

00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:34.765
From climate change, mass migration,

00:06:34.765 --> 00:06:37.726
pandemics, job loss

00:06:37.768 --> 00:06:38.936
and now war.

00:06:39.728 --> 00:06:42.773
The future feels terrifying
for many people.

00:06:43.858 --> 00:06:46.694
And this is having a tremendous impact
on our mental health.

00:06:47.361 --> 00:06:49.530
One third of all
US undergraduates surveyed

00:06:49.572 --> 00:06:51.991
report having moderate to severe anxiety.

00:06:52.366 --> 00:06:55.703
Their rates of suicidal thinking
and severe depression

00:06:55.744 --> 00:06:58.122
doubled over the last decade or so.

00:06:59.248 --> 00:07:00.916
And COVID didn't help.